# View KML: the planning screen's lnk_kml, GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:4318-4328 - Process.Start of
# http://127.0.0.1:56781/network.kml, the built-in HTTP server's Google Earth network link (the
# server itself is Utilities/httpserver.cs, its own row), and "Failed to open url ..." when the
# desktop cannot open it - on the status line here.
#
# The desktop's opener is not launched under the harness: MP_OPEN_WITH_SHELL_LOG names a file the
# planner appends what it would have opened to, and the fact says what the click did.
#
# Needs no link: tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/plan-kml-link.gui

env MP_OPEN_WITH_SHELL_LOG $WORK/opened.txt

screen plan
window 1600x1200
budget 2

expect plan.kml.link none
click plan-kml
expect plan.kml.link opened http://127.0.0.1:56781/network.kml
